            <h1>Proposition 65</h1>
        </div>
        <p>
            California’s Proposition 65 requires businesses to display this
            warning unless extensive, continuous testing is conducted to verify
            zero traces of over 900 listed chemicals, even if levels fall well
            within federal safety standards. We include this warning on our
            packaging out of caution and to comply with California law.
        </p>
        <p>
            The presence of this label does not mean our products are unsafe or
            violate any federal quality guidelines. Your safety is our top
            priority, and all of our products are built with high-quality
            materials designed for everyday use.
        </p>
